  "_about": "interface corrections found in the hand phase (docs/handoff/escalation-a-s-20261117.md), on in the 11-19 exam, missing from the 11-20 loop. amo_arm_pos: the AMO robot's arm actuators (BendPickMP, TabletopGraspMP) are position servos and get the target angle, not a torque (BendPick 0 -> 6 / 10 by hand). feed_torque: leg odometry reads the foot loads from the robot's own torque command; without it the loads read 0 in the official environment and the pelvis estimate drifts when a foot moves (PickBetweenTables release error 20 -> 1 cm by hand).",
